                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "54670c2a-ac6a-4a79-9928-42bb8891b663",
                                "sense_id": "55655c60-ec4d-31e4-8bf5-bc1b84cf869a",
                                "text": "like the blasting Siroc of the sands,\nThe ruin of the royal voice\nFound its way everywhere"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3754f5a1-bb16-4065-9a40-fbc44650cb52",
                                "sense_id": "55655c60-ec4d-31e4-8bf5-bc1b84cf869a",
                                "text": "Full swiftly blew the swift Siroc,\nWhen last I press'd thy lip;\nAnd long ere now, with foaming shock\nImpell'd thy gallant ship."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a04e644-9c38-4851-b9de-1ab221256e21",
                                "sense_id": "55655c60-ec4d-31e4-8bf5-bc1b84cf869a",
                                "text": "I listened to every blast of wind as if it were a dull ugly siroc on its way to consume me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc60a817-120c-4f83-b9bd-7e64327040af",
                                "sense_id": "55655c60-ec4d-31e4-8bf5-bc1b84cf869a",
                                "text": "These the siroc could not melt,\nFire their fiercer flaming felt,\nAnd the meaning was more white\nThan July's meridian light."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
